<!-- wp:group {"className":"rivage-page-intro rivage-wrap","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group rivage-page-intro rivage-wrap"><!-- wp:post-title {"level":1} /--><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How this fictional hotel demo handles request information.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"rivage-wrap rivage-section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group rivage-wrap rivage-section"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Information you submit.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A request stores your name, email, chosen category, stay dates, adult/child counts, optional message, quote and booking status. We do not collect payment details or require a customer account. Use test details for this demonstration.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Who can access it.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hotel administrators can review requests. Emails contain verification links and stay details. In this local demonstration, emails are captured in the test mailbox; they are not delivered to real recipients. Production hosting and mail delivery will be identified here before deployment.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Storage and retention.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Unverified requests are deleted after 24 hours. Other request records and related email records are deleted 90 days after the stay ends, through scheduled cleanup. Cleanup runs when the site receives traffic. Verification links expire after 30 minutes, and only token hashes are retained in the request record. A pending email may temporarily contain its verification link until it is sent.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Signed form keys prevent duplicate submissions. Short-lived request limits use salted hashes of connection/email identifiers, rather than storing raw IP addresses. The request receipt lasts one hour. WordPress administration uses its normal login cookies. No analytics service has been added.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Corrections and deletion.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact the project owner through the portfolio listing if you need submitted demonstration data corrected or removed. Booking records are private and are not exposed as public pages.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->
